{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25956","headline":"述德上太原严尚书绶 · 鲍溶","name":"述德上太原严尚书绶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝命河岳神，降灵翼轩辕。\n天王委管龠，开闭秦门北。\n顶戴日月光，口宣雨露言。\n甲马不及汗，天骄自亡魂。\n清塚入内地，黄河穷本源。\n风云寝气象，鸟兽翔旗旛。\n军人歌无胡，长劒倚崑仑。\n终古鞭血地，到今耕稼繁。\n樵客天一畔，何由拜旌轩。\n愿请执御臣，爲公动朱轓。\n岂令羣荒外，尚有辜帝恩。\n愿陈田舍歌，暂息四坐喧。\n条桑去附枝，薙草绝本根。\n可惜汉公主，哀哀嫁乌孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}